L13: #### To install Bun
L14: 
L15: [Button: curl][Button: npm][Button: powershell][Button: scoop][Button: brew][Button: docker]
L16: 
L17: curl
L18: 
L19:     `curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash`
